          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "राय (rāy) is a loan from Arabic raʾy, \"opinion, view\", which reached Hindi through Persian. Its Arabic root is r-ʾ-y (Lane). It is a different word from the older Hindi rāy, \"king\", from Sanskrit rājan (CDIAL 10679)."
            }
